                                EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%AF%92%E9%A9%AC%E9%93%83%E8%96%AF%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip3:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 金胡萝卜" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="金胡萝卜能够制作夜视药水可能是由于现实中胡萝卜对视力的保护作用（内含大量的β-胡萝卜素）。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 钓鱼竿" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="若玩家乘坐矿车时一直抛竿钓住该矿车并收竿，矿车就会飞起来。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 炼药锅" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="基岩版箭无法进入炼药锅的内部，只会悬浮在炼药锅内壁的上方。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                            <TextBlock Text="来源：" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       Foreground="#4A8CF7" />
